Z||000001||Carrolles||09-18-2001||03:36 PM||||Sitting for a couple of months doesn't mean it is bad or has problems.<P>Does it run?  If so warm it up and change the oil and filter.  You might try some fuel injector cleaner in the gas tank and charge the battery before you run it to prevent alternator death if you jump start a dead battery.||||reg||1
