Z||000004||1FST2M6||09-19-2001||01:53 PM||||150 shot.. uum..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>to add more on the low end, port the stock manifolds don't waste you time with headers,  MSD 6a or al. Crane PS91-92 or LX91-92 coil, new plugs NGK ur5. uum a fuel injection service. K&N stock replacement (good for a whoping 3hp!) <P>or nitrous.. and lots of it...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  NOTHIN says lovin like the headreast smashing you in the back of the head! <P>------------------<BR>12.920@109mph... "thats all I have to say about that"||||reg||1
